id: pm-oybmsd
title: Align SDK producer-continuation result types with sparse reference envelopes
description: "During default-list acceptance, native PmClient.list({brief:true,limit:'1',after:cursor}) returns a sparse reference envelope ending with next_cursor:null; fields such as has_more and sorting are intentionally absent. ListResultBase and ListVerboseResult still require those fields, and PmReadOutputResultFor considers budget/session/outputCursor but not producer after options. Audit the public return-type contract against the advertised continuation envelope before choosing a fix; preserve the intentional runtime metadata-reference optimization."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags[3]: pagination,sdk,types
