updated_at: "2026-10-20T07:43:13.561Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Type fixtures reflect first-page and producer-continuation envelopes without promising absent fields; CLI SDK and MCP serialized continuations retain complete membership and sparse metadata; public surface compatibility and packed consumer checks pass
parent: pm-srns
risk: medium
confidence: high
expected_result: Typed SDK callers can handle sparse producer continuations safely without casts or assumptions about omitted first-page metadata.
